{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo eliminate $p,$ we first solve the first equation for $p:$\n\n$$\np={(\\frac{x}{4})}^{1/3}\n$$\n\nNext, let's substitute this expression for $p$ into the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =3{p}^{4} \\\\  & =3{({(\\frac{x}{4})}^{1/3})}^{4} \\\\  & =3{(\\frac{x}{4})}^{4/3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the explicit form of the singular solution is\n\n$$\ny=3{(\\frac{x}{4})}^{4/3}.\n$$" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332138 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332139 13194139535117 true] [17592186332138 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332140 13194139535117 true] [17592186332138 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332141 13194139535117 true] [17592186332138 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332142 13194139535117 true] [17592186332138 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332143 13194139535117 true] [17592186332138 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535117 true] [17592186332138 1041 "selection" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332138 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332141 13194139535117 true] [17592186332138 1110 #uuid "212c49ce-46a0-5c4a-b839-6857fb18c4cd" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332139 1034 "y=-3{(\\frac{x}{9})}^{4/3}" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332139 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535117 true] [17592186332139 1111 #uuid "253af831-88c6-54ad-93ad-b1b8f9ef7516" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332140 1034 "y=-3{(\\frac{x}{4})}^{4/3}" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332140 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535117 true] [17592186332140 1111 #uuid "65c90fec-cc2d-5e60-aadc-a19419be502b" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332141 1034 "y=3{(\\frac{x}{4})}^{4/3}" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332141 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535117 true] [17592186332141 1111 #uuid "15b39a68-1707-562b-91d6-8d124c73151f" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332142 1034 "y=-3{x}^{4/3}" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332142 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535117 true] [17592186332142 1111 #uuid "3f247143-3e5f-5a8e-8f17-0b10145d452f" 13194139535117 true] [17592186332143 1034 "y=\\frac{3{x}^{4}}{4}" 13194139535117 true] [175921863